# Build directories — the default `./build` and any custom BUILDDIR
# (`make BUILDDIR=./build-clang`, `build-gcc`, …). The trailing `/` keeps it
# to directories; the glob catches every variant so compiled test binaries
# (which are extensionless ELF files, not caught by *.out/*.exe) never leak in.
build*/

# Generated docs — never committed, so they cannot drift from the source (#452).
# The Autodoc page is produced from the header doc-comments by `bash
# docs/gen-api.sh` (doxygen -> moxygen), and .github/workflows/docs.yaml
# regenerates it fresh right before `zensical build`, so the deployed site is
# always current. Run gen-api.sh once before a local `zensical build`/`serve`
# if you want the page in your preview.
docs/api/
# Zensical's rendered site (`zensical build` -> site/).
site/

# Prerequisites
*.d

# Compiled Object files
*.slo
*.lo
*.o
*.obj

# Precompiled Headers
*.gch
*.pch

# Compiled Dynamic libraries
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll

# Fortran module files
*.mod
*.smod

# Compiled Static libraries
*.lai
*.la
*.a
*.lib

# Executables
*.exe
*.out
*.app

# vscode
.vscode
.claude/worktrees/
